    "lineStart": 0,
    "memoText": "\n                         VETO MESSAGE - No. 495\n\nTO THE ASSEMBLY:\n\nI am returning herewith, without my approval, the following bill:\n\nAssembly Bill Number 8320-B, entitled:\n\n    \"AN  ACT  to  amend the real property tax law, in relation to a real\n      property tax exemption for  farm  dwellings  owned  by  a  limited\n      liability company\"\n\n    NOT APPROVED\n\n  This  bill  would extend the STAR exemption in farm dwellings owned by\nan LLC, a measure which would have  an  annual  fiscal  impact  of  $2.5\nmillion.    Consideration  of  legislation  with such an impact on State\nfinances should occur in the context of negotiating the budget, when all\nof the State's fiscal needs are considered in a  comprehensive  fashion.\nFor this reason, I must disapprove this legislation.\n\n  The bill is disapproved.                    (signed) ANDREW M. CUOMO\n                              __________\n",
    "signedDate": null,
    "signer": "ANDREW M. CUOMO",
    "vetoNumber": 495,
    "vetoType": "STANDARD",
    "year": 2014
   }
  ],
